 This install applies to "RAY Pokeri", an unofficial Amiga port of the 1986
 Finnish video poker machine by RAY (Raha-automaattiyhdistys).


 Requirements:
 -------------
 This install requires WHDLoad version 17.0 or better and a PAL Amiga with a
 68020 or better. AGA is recommended. The installed program uses 864 KB
 ChipMem and 1472 KB OtherMem, including its Kickstart image.

 The game requires an installed A600/A1200/A4000 Kickstart 3.1 image.
 The kickstart image must be located in the directory "Devs:Kickstarts" and
 must be named "kick40063.A600", "kick40068.A1200" or "kick40068.A4000".
 Additionally the file "kick40063.A600.RTB", "kick40068.A1200.RTB" or
 "kick40068.A4000.RTB" must be installed in the same directory as the kickstart
 image. It can be found in the archive "util/boot/skick346.lha" on aminet.


 Installation:
 -------------
 The install does not include the original game ROMs. Run the Install icon and
 select the drawer containing these four files, each 65536 bytes:

   77POK30   SHA-256 2841c2393d469c744eb5e575b08f1e4f13320e73fd205eb27d2ea2cf4b59decd
   77POK38   SHA-256 fd87d156b71753d7ba03f548bf12bc3fee1d16477d1e89a9e9fe36521808ec8e
   77POK34   SHA-256 3facfb79dfd6942a197bc6f9456712cb1a0de92e0035a589711988148f07c0a7
   PARA200J  SHA-256 ae1b91f898d8d69a36fde41bff1139c94c8b9cb93e77b4c697ddc43a362d244b

 The installer also creates the save files nvram.bin and accounting.bin, which
 keep the machine's credits and accounting. Reinstalling with Keep preserves
 them.


 First run:
 ----------
 The first run takes longer while the original machine initializes. Please
 wait until the game is ready. Quit with Escape or the left mouse button to
 save the initialized state; subsequent starts will be quicker.


 Quitting:
 ---------
 Escape or the left mouse button quits and saves. The WHDLoad QuitKey (Help)
 quits immediately without saving.


 Controls:
 ---------
 Enter           insert coin
 Space           deal / draw
 F1-F5           hold cards 1-5
 F6              double
 F7 / F8         low / high
 F9              bet
 F10             collect winnings


 History:
 --------
 version 0.91 (11.10.2026):
 - fixed a crash after inserting a coin on real Amiga hardware


